@citolab/pci-geogebra-applet

This PCI is a derivative work of the GeoGebra PCI (GGBPCI) in janfix/extension-geogebra
(https://github.com/janfix/extension-geogebra), by Jean-Philippe Rivière (Wiquid). The PCI code of that extension is
"subject to the GeoGebra Non-Commercial License Agreement, see http://www.geogebra.org/license" (as stated in the
headers of its files and in its README), so this PCI is too. Its TAO installer (PHP) is GPL-2.0-only; that part is not
used here. Where the two disagree, this PCI follows the stricter one: the GeoGebra licence below.

Changes: Copyright (c) 2026 Stichting Cito Instituut voor Toetsontwikkeling, under the same licence.

For commercial use, contact GeoGebra GmbH at office@geogebra.org.

The text below is copied from https://www.geogebra.org/license (retrieved November 2026). The version on that page is
the one that applies.

